# Ruling: the ability resolves even if the spell that caused it is countered. Bot1's second spell on turn 3, Mox Jet,
# is countered by Bot2's Counterspell (Island and Mox Sapphire); the trigger, which sits above Mox Jet on the stack,
# resolves first and Zenith gets its +1/+1 counter, and Counterspell then counters Mox Jet.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Cosmogrand Zenith
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Counterspell
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cosmogrand Zenith.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Put a +1/+1 counter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Counterspell.Cast(Mox Jet)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
